   "lines": [
    "Took a ten mile",
    "tramp with Sewell;",
    "I saw nothing",
    "in the woods",
    "but after a",
    "rather neat",
    "stalk killed a",
    "duck in a",
    "small lake.",
    "Was nicely sold",
    "by the boys with",
    "a dead duck",
    "placed in a life",
    "like attitude in a",
    "pond. Have had",
    "beautiful baths in the",
    "dam[?]race every day."
   ],
   "rows": null,
   "columns": null,
   "confidence": "medium",
   "note": "'damrace' written with an extra stroke between dam and race"
